# Only Edit Inside This Repo

Only create, edit, or delete files inside this repository's tree. Everything outside the repo root is read-only for the agent.

## Never modify

- Files outside this repo: other checkouts (e.g. `The-Channel`), `$HOME`, `/tmp`, `/usr/local`, system headers, or any path not under this repo root.
- Dependencies this repo does not control: system/Homebrew libraries (e.g. GMP, OpenSSL), global toolchains, SDKs, and installed packages.
- Git submodules and other underlying library repos checked out under this tree (boost, appbase, eos-vm, softfloat, boringssl, etc.) - they are their own repositories; changes there will not show up here.

## If a fix can only live outside this repo

Stop. Do not work around it with throwaway stubs, shim libraries linked into test binaries, or scratch scripts under `/tmp`. Report the blocker and what would be needed (e.g. "no arm64 GMP on this machine") and let the user decide.

## Builds

Build only into in-repo build directories (`build*`). Do not install into system paths, and do not `sudo` anything.
